1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
I'm Juha Lilja, team APN201.
Our challenge: Abandoned but not Forgotten.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
This is a webcam at the Apollo 12 landing site.
Live, tonight.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Rewind, and fifty-seven years run backwards...

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
...until Surveyor 3 stands alone
in its crater, in 1967.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Every machine appears and vanishes
at the minute it really did.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,000
But there is no camera. Every frame is calculated
from NASA data: terrain, positions, times, Sun and Earth.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Next: every Apollo site, and Mars.
Try it: oos.helppox.com
